sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (browser)
  participant A as /api/import
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant E as MiniLM embedder
  participant P as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  U->>A: POST file text (CSV / JSON)
  A->>P: same file already imported? (imports.file_hash)
  A->>M: find bank profile (bank_profiles)
  A->>M: insertOne raw_statements {records, status: processing}
  A->>P: normalize_merchant() for every row
  A->>E: embed each distinct merchant once
  A->>P: BEGIN
  A->>P: INSERT imports, INSERT transactions (trigger T4 auto-categorises)
  A->>P: SELECT detect_subscriptions(account) (trigger T1 logs price rises)
  A->>P: COMMIT (or ROLLBACK on any error)
  A->>M: updateOne {status: imported, import_id, result}
  A-->>U: inserted / skipped / subscriptions found
